<SiteLayout title="Refund Policy — Zskylo">
  <section class="page-hero wrap legal-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Legal / Refunds</p><h1>Refund <span class="text-blue">policy.</span></h1></section>
  <article class="wrap legal-content"><p class="legal-draft">Project-specific payment, cancellation and refund terms should be agreed in writing before work begins.</p><h2>Project work</h2><p>Fees, milestones, deposits, cancellation terms and any refund eligibility for a project will be described in the relevant written proposal or service agreement before work begins.</p><h2>Requests and questions</h2><p>If you have a question about a payment or an agreed project, contact <a href="mailto:hello@zskylo.com">hello@zskylo.com</a> and include the relevant project or invoice reference. We will review the request against the written agreement.</p></article>
</SiteLayout>
